# 📄 ATS Resume Checker

A Streamlit app that scores a resume for ATS (Applicant Tracking System) compatibility and tells you exactly what to improve. Upload a PDF or DOCX, optionally paste a job description, and Google Gemini Flash does the analysis.

## Features

- Upload a **PDF or DOCX** resume (max 5 MB)
- **Overall ATS score (0-100)** built from five weighted categories
- Optional **job description** input for a real keyword-match score
- **Prioritized improvements** (High / Medium / Low) with before/after style examples
- **Missing keywords**, strengths, weaknesses and ATS formatting problems
- Facts from the file itself: word count, pages, tables, bullet count, email/phone/LinkedIn found
- **Download the report** as Markdown

## How the score works

Gemini rates five categories from 0 to 100. The app then calculates the overall score itself, so the number is consistent and explainable:

| Category | Weight |
|---|---|
| Keywords & relevance | 30% |
| Formatting & parsability | 20% |
| Section structure | 20% |
| Impact & achievements | 20% |
| Readability & language | 10% |

This is an estimate. Real ATS products differ, so treat the score as guidance, not a guarantee.

